#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:1
msgid "Binary Installation on Ubuntu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:3
msgid ""
"Garden binaries are provided for Ubuntu Focal and Jammy. The Garden binaries "
"are hosted in the packages.osrfoundation.org repository. To install all of "
"them, the metapackage `gz-garden` can be installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:7
msgid ""
"<div class=\"warning\">\n"
"WARNING: for gazebo-classic (eg. `gazebo11`) users: `gz-garden` cannot be\n"
"installed alongside with `gazebo11` by default. To facilitate the migration\n"
"this can be done using the instruction detailed in\n"
"<a href=\"https://gazebosim.org/docs/garden/"
"install_gz11_side_by_side\">Installing Gazebo11 side by side with new "
"Gazebo</a>\n"
"</div>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:14
msgid "First install some necessary tools:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:16
msgid ""
"sudo apt-get update\n"
"sudo apt-get install lsb-release curl gnupg\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:21
msgid "Then install Gazebo Garden:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:24
msgid ""
"sudo curl https://packages.osrfoundation.org/gazebo.gpg --output /usr/share/"
"keyrings/pkgs-osrf-archive-keyring.gpg\n"
"echo \"deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/"
"pkgs-osrf-archive-keyring.gpg] https://packages.osrfoundation.org/gazebo/"
"ubuntu-stable $(lsb_release -cs) main\" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/"
"gazebo-stable.list > /dev/null\n"
"sudo apt-get update\n"
"sudo apt-get install gz-garden\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:31
msgid ""
"All libraries should be ready to use and the `gz sim` app ready to be "
"executed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:33
msgid ""
"Head back to the [Getting started](getstarted) page to start using Gazebo!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:37
msgid "Uninstalling binary install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:39
msgid ""
"If you need to uninstall Gazebo or switch to a source-based install once you "
"have already installed the library from binaries, run the following command:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install_ubuntu.md:42
msgid "sudo apt remove gz-garden && sudo apt autoremove\n"
msgstr ""

